  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I have noticed other users wanting to be able to either customize the keyboard key assignments and able to work with non QWERT keyboard layouts. Some things like being able to assign a specific key for entering portals would also be nice as even if it makes it less likely to accidently to enter a portal with portal prompt enabled. It still is possible to enter when trying to pick up an object or interact with a chair when a portal is placed down too close.\n\nI would love to see a settings menu that allows for both customizing keybinds for individual features along with presets for other keyboard layouts to give flexibility for users that need this. I would prefer the settings for this to be stored in a file in case it needs to be reset for any reason and not stored in the registry.",
